The [[Healing Herbs]] are an item available in the shop for all characters, at common rarity. Besides the obvious small amount of healing the [[Healing Herbs]] provides for any character, the [[Healing Herbs]] make a great addition to a [[Ranger]]'s [[Vineweave Basket]], increasing their healing while providing some healing of its own. The [[Healing Herbs]] also segue nicely into a [[Hungry Blade]] build, since the [[Hungry Blade]] requires {{icon/regeneration}} to produce {{icon/vampirism}}, which then powers it up. The [[Healing Herbs]] can also be used to craft the [[Health Potion]] into the much stronger [[Strong Health Potion]]. Because of this, the [[Healing Herbs]] have even more to offer a [[Vampirism]] build, since the [[Strong Health Potion]] can then be crafted into the [[Vampiric Potion]].
